[quote="Silverleaf"]

I have to admit I&#39;ve thought about it.&nbsp;After all, I did design a MLP crochet pattern last year.The difficult bit would be deciding on the colours, and getting the cutie marks to look perfect.Legacy - I guess white, blue mane/tail.Tachyon - white, red mane/tail, those red rings on her legs.Bunker - I&#39;d add layers of plating to bulk him up, not sure how the mane/tail would work.AZ - similar, what to do about the mane/tail?Wraith - got to have some purple, don&#39;t know what other colours. Tricky.&nbsp;

[/quote]

&nbsp;

I&#39;d have AZ with a black body with blue highlights and an electric blue mohawk mane and tail.

Wraith, not sure about the body, but her hoofs would be purple and she&#39;d have white wraps going up her legs and a cape going over her mane (black).

Bunker is hard, but could you do occasional lines of &#39;bumps&#39; (not sure how to describe it) to represent bolts? That way you could enschew a mane/tail altogether.

&nbsp;

Also a quick suggestion about pony types. Legacy should be a pegasus. Tachyon and AZ should be unicorns. And Bunker and Wraith should be earth ponies.
